      "level": 3,
      "title": "Updating MinimumFileVersion After an App Update"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Scenario: 7-Zip updated from 24.08 to 24.09"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Existing policy has MinimumFileVersion=\"24.08.0.0\""
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "New version is 24.09.0.0 — this PASSES the existing rule (>= 24.08)"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "No policy update needed for upgrades!"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "BUT: if you want to RAISE the floor (require 24.09+ to block 24.08):"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "1. Rescan with the new version installed"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "2. The new rule will have MinimumFileVersion=\"24.09.0.0\""
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "title": "3. Deploy the updated policy — now v24.08 is blocked"
    },
